    "title": "Austin Picklehaus Opens Seven Courts, a Cafe and Founding Memberships in Pflugerville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Mitchell ,\n10 hours ago A new indoor pickleball club has opened its doors in Pflugerville, bringing seven courts, a full cafe and round-the-clock-feeling hours to a corner of the Austin area where paddle sports keep multiplying. Austin Picklehaus opened at 18629 Weiss Lane, Building 2, and is running daily from 7 a.m. to midnight, giving both members and drop-in players plenty of room to book a game. Read full article",
